@host = http://localhost:5252
@demoPassword = replace-with-local-demo-password
@accessToken = paste-jwt-access-token-here

### Health

GET {{host}}/api/health
Accept: application/json

### Login as demo Employee

POST {{host}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "employee.demo@example.com",
  "password": "{{demoPassword}}"
}

### Current employee leave requests

GET {{host}}/api/leave-requests/mine
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Accept: application/json